I noticed a problem in my proposal (when the transaction proceeds, the dnf5 assumes particular output format which `etckeeper post-install` obviously doesn't follow) and fixed it by dropping `raise_error=1` from the post transaction hook (this is not necessary anyway).

Updated patch in dnf5 branch here: <https://gitlab.com/marbu/etckeeper.branchable.com/-/blob/dnf5/etckeeper-dnf5/etckeeper.actions?ref_type=heads>
"""]]
